	quest.001C555AEB20440F.quest_desc: ["Ender IO Mod Returns to Minecraft 1.20: Ender IO, the popular Minecraft mod known for its versatile conduits, machines, and enhancements, is now back and available for Minecraft version 1.20. Explore its advanced machinery and power transfer systems in this latest edition of the beloved mod."]
	quest.001C555AEB20440F.quest_subtitle: "Better pipes than Pipez "
	quest.001C555AEB20440F.title: "&2EnderIO"
	quest.035785D84AF1B696.quest_subtitle: "Reflect a Laser into at least 8 Malachite Reflectors"
	quest.035785D84AF1B696.title: "Master of Re-direction"
	quest.03641AFA0F2B23C0.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain, something of equal value must be lost. That is Alchemy's first law of Equivalent Exchange."
		"This mod allows you to harness the power of alchemy for yourself and transmute items to other items that are equal in value."
		""
		"Balance Shard: A crafting ingredient that has a 4% chance to drop from all hostile mobs"
	]
	quest.03641AFA0F2B23C0.quest_subtitle: "ProjectE?"
	quest.03641AFA0F2B23C0.title: "EMC Without EMC"
	quest.03ABEC8EBEB24DAE.quest_subtitle: "The 'ore'-iginal treasure hunt!"
	quest.03ABEC8EBEB24DAE.title: "&aFirst Upgrade"
	quest.04441ADE9330C23D.quest_desc: ["Entangled gives you the materials needed to bind two blocks together, allowing you to interact with either one as if they were the same block! This will allow you to transfer items, energy, fluids or whatever you want instantly, you can have more than six sides to work with or you could just hide your messy cables, the possibilities are endless!"]
	quest.04441ADE9330C23D.quest_subtitle: "Web of possibilities"
	quest.0446F38182C65896.quest_desc: ["A new villager profession - Wanderer. This guy is not going to annoy you, or run away with a caravan of llamas. He is an ordinary villager who sells you rare goods. His appearance is a bit different from Wandering Trader since it has small details depending on biome."]
	quest.0446F38182C65896.quest_subtitle: "More of this guy?"
	quest.05BF62BFCDE46A92.quest_desc: ["This mod introduces several portable workbenches mounted on sticks, designed to simplify life, especially in the early stages of your journey. Additionally, you can assign a hotkey to access the crafting table in your Curio slot, allowing you to open it without needing it in your inventory!"]
	quest.05BF62BFCDE46A92.quest_subtitle: "Stick With Me"
	quest.05BF62BFCDE46A92.title: "Everything On A Stick"
	quest.07B0BFCA03851B4A.quest_desc: ["You might have noticed the absence of tool mods like Silent Gears and Tinkers' Construct. The reason behind this choice is to encourage you to explore and utilize alternative tools from other mods included in the pack, such as Cyclic and many more. Best of luck in your quest to discover the most suitable tools for your adventure!"]
	quest.07B0BFCA03851B4A.quest_subtitle: "'Pick' your tools"
	quest.0842C4C63F71ED78.title: "Kill Ender Dragon"
	quest.08CFD041E9E10628.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a Sniffer Egg"
	quest.08CFD041E9E10628.title: "Smells Interesting"
	quest.096659FC3A9AD7EF.quest_subtitle: "Weak Elytra"
	quest.09F5108AD63673C1.quest_subtitle: "Look at all Passerine bird Variants through a spyglass!"
	quest.09F5108AD63673C1.title: "Ornithologist"
	quest.1252DBFA736AABE6.quest_desc: ["Powah is a tech mod that introduces diverse methods for generating, storing, and transmitting Forge Energy. Let these guidebooks power your path!"]
	quest.1252DBFA736AABE6.quest_subtitle: "I've Got The Powah"
	quest.1252DBFA736AABE6.title: "&cPowah"
	quest.12A789C4D0DC8508.quest_desc: ["Explore the foundational Thermal Series mods, a decade-strong force in modded Minecraft. Unveil pioneering advancements, from Forge Energy to modular flexibility. Experience the evolving, tech-infused universe in this Core and Foundation module."]
	quest.12A789C4D0DC8508.quest_subtitle: "The Thermal Evolution"
	quest.12A789C4D0DC8508.title: "&2Thermal Series"
	quest.131E878262A7EE6D.quest_desc: [
		"The dimensional mineshaft houses a Djinni which opens up a stable connection into an uninhabited dimension, perfectly suited for mining. While the portal is too small to transfer humans, other spirits can use it to enter the mining dimension and bring back resources."
		""
		"The mineshaft is activated by placing a miner spirit, summoned into a magic lamp, into the input slot. The spirit will then bring resources from a theoretical mining dimension and place them in the output slots. If all output slots are filled, additional items are discarded."
	]
	quest.131E878262A7EE6D.quest_subtitle: "It's all about the 'spirit' of automation!"
	quest.131E878262A7EE6D.title: "&eRub The Lamp"
	quest.147F2EEADDAC9B6E.quest_desc: ["Can move mobs simple as that!"]
	quest.147F2EEADDAC9B6E.quest_subtitle: "Moving ME"
	quest.153875FBA1C33F28.quest_subtitle: "Grind an Enchanted Golden Apple"
	quest.153875FBA1C33F28.title: "Why Would You Do That!?"
	quest.15B33100403EF393.quest_desc: ["The interesting aspect of using Industrial Foregoing's Laser Drills is that the biome where you place them matters a long with the Y lv you set it to. Depending on the biome, you can generate resources specific to that biome, such as Ancient Debris from the Nether Biomes. Additionally, you can increase your chances of obtaining certain ores by using lenses of different colors. This becomes especially powerful when you use more than four laser drills and maximize the upgrades for each."]
	quest.15B33100403EF393.quest_subtitle: "RF to ITEMS"
	quest.15B33100403EF393.title: "&eMining With Lasers"
	quest.16E9BCA5FC2ECEFE.quest_subtitle: "Have all Froglights in your inventory"
	quest.16E9BCA5FC2ECEFE.title: "With Our Powers Combined!"
	quest.175F47500A075692.quest_subtitle: "Obtain an entire Ratlantis armor set"
	quest.175F47500A075692.title: "The Gilded God!"
	quest.19884E0FAB4A0C6F.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome, adventurer, to the vast and wondrous world of &l&6Modded Oneblock 1&r! In this epic journey, you'll embark on a thrilling exploration of the amazing mods available in the 1.20s version of Minecraft."
		""
		"Your adventure begins here, and the possibilities are endless. Whether you're an experienced modded Minecraft player or new to the world of modifications, this quest book will be your guide to unlocking the mysteries and marvels that await."
	]
	quest.19884E0FAB4A0C6F.quest_subtitle: "ADVENTURE TIME"
	quest.19884E0FAB4A0C6F.title: "&bWelcome Adventurer!"
	quest.1A05063D95EB59D3.quest_desc: ["The \"FramedBlocks\" mod for Minecraft, introduces various decorative and versatile blocks that can mimic the appearance of almost any other block in the game. These blocks come in a wide range of shapes, allowing players to customize their builds and add intricate details to their structures."]
	quest.1A05063D95EB59D3.quest_subtitle: "'Frame' of reference!"
	quest.1A05063D95EB59D3.title: "Framed Blocks"
	quest.1AEE50516ECB302A.quest_subtitle: "Creeper troubles? Boom, it's gone!"
	quest.1AEE50516ECB302A.title: "&aRUN!"
	quest.1BA4593E1826A777.quest_desc: ["Sophisticated backpacks is yet another backpack mod this time with backpack you can place in world, color in different color combinations, upgrade with more inventory and enhance with many functional upgrades. UPGRADE AWAY!"]
	quest.1BA4593E1826A777.quest_subtitle: "You can carry HOW much???"
	quest.1BA4593E1826A777.title: "Advanced Backpacks"
	quest.1CECD4FF5DFE74C2.quest_subtitle: "Copy 1000 Books using Create"
	quest.1CECD4FF5DFE74C2.title: "Great Publisher"
	quest.1FC560E4565901E2.quest_subtitle: "Collect every Bioshroom type"
	quest.1FC560E4565901E2.title: "Mycologist"
	quest.214D647C4918E13D.quest_desc: ["In this quest, you'll embark on a magical journey into the enchanting realms of mystical and arcane mods. These mods introduce powerful spells, ancient artifacts, and mysterious dimensions that can transform your Minecraft world into a realm of wonder and sorcery. From mastering the art of spellcasting to summoning otherworldly creatures, you'll delve into the enchanting side of Minecraft. Get ready to explore the captivating and spellbinding possibilities that magic mods have to offer!"]
	quest.214D647C4918E13D.quest_subtitle: "Spell crafting \\& more"
	quest.214D647C4918E13D.title: "&dMagic Starts Here"
	quest.246AD8A89BD3336A.quest_desc: ["Choose any of these generators to embark on your RF production journey!"]
	quest.246AD8A89BD3336A.quest_subtitle: "Burn baby BURN!"
	quest.246AD8A89BD3336A.title: "&cStarter Generators"
	quest.2853C03018667258.quest_desc: ["This mod features a straightforward magnet with assignable hotkeys for toggling it on or off. Additionally, you can strategically place demagnetizers in specific areas to prevent the magnet's effect within a localized zone."]
	quest.2853C03018667258.quest_subtitle: "Become Attractive"
	quest.2BB0CEB2BDCB2F06.quest_desc: [
		"The Slingshot Mod introduces a fascinating tool to your Minecraft adventures. This unique tool allows you to shoot blocks with precision and creativity."
		""
		"&lQuick Charge:&r Speed up your block-shooting abilities, making building and designing faster and more efficient."
		""
		"&lMulti Shot:&r Shoot multiple blocks simultaneously, enabling you to create intricate structures with ease."
		""
		"&lStasis:&r Discover the exclusive Stasis enchantment, obtainable in end cities. Slingshots enchanted with Stasis gain remarkable capabilities. They can shoot blocks in a perfectly straight line, defying gravity. Additionally, projectiles fired from a Stasis-enchanted Slingshot will display a white block outline, providing a clear preview of where they will land."
	]
	quest.2BB0CEB2BDCB2F06.quest_subtitle: "Don't Go YEETING Crates"
	quest.2CB1A2AE0D744183.quest_desc: ["No longer are you limited by your basic inventory chest. With this mod, you can effortlessly transfer items across vast distances and even between dimensions. You can even establish distinct channels using colors, ensuring that you never mix items and fluids that you don't want to mix."]
	quest.2CB1A2AE0D744183.quest_subtitle: "Make storage 'ender'esting "
	quest.2CB1A2AE0D744183.title: "Ender Transfer"
	quest.2DF75B742CF213F2.quest_desc: ["Comign Soon"]
	quest.2DF75B742CF213F2.quest_subtitle: "How to Enable or Disable Shaders"
	quest.2E58477B5F4D57B1.quest_desc: ["You can also gather resources by clearing out all the blocks in a designated area. To use the Builder as a quarry, you'll require a Shape Card (Quarry), a Builder, and a Lever. Additionally, ensure you have a power source and a large chest to store the collected items. This is a fun way of gathering large ammounts of blocks from diffrents areas!"]
	quest.2E58477B5F4D57B1.quest_subtitle: "Wait? Isn't This A BuIlDeR???"
	quest.2E58477B5F4D57B1.title: "&eQuarry"
	quest.2ECEB9E5C5ADB029.quest_desc: ["Yes, you can use the Rats to mine for you... "]
	quest.2ECEB9E5C5ADB029.quest_subtitle: "'Tail'ented at sniffing out valuables!"
	quest.2ECEB9E5C5ADB029.title: "&eRatamatouille: The Mining Maestro"
	quest.2EE2CC9B64908EF8.quest_desc: ["Chicken Feeds are a unique feature within the mod that allows players to click them onto chickens, resulting in the production of eggs. These eggs can be of either a Hostile farm or a Passive mob farm variety. When you click these eggs onto dirt blocks, they transform the area into a 5x5 spawning zone, with mob spawns dependent on the specific conditions required by the mobs. For Passive mob farms, it's important to note that grass may grow over time, so periodically clearing the grass is necessary to facilitate mob spawning."]
	quest.2EE2CC9B64908EF8.title: "Easy Mob Farms"
	quest.3201F06AED8A1577.quest_desc: [
		"All accessories have randomized efficiency bonus which makes them more or less useful."
		"The description is generated dynamically to show you the final value with efficiency included."
	]
	quest.3201F06AED8A1577.quest_subtitle: "Looting Is GOOD!"
	quest.3201F06AED8A1577.title: "Majrusz's Accessories"
	quest.334856E8FD949CFA.quest_subtitle: "Stopping The Unstoppable"
	quest.334856E8FD949CFA.title: "&aWhy Must You Do This?"
	quest.33C05CA3A06893C4.quest_subtitle: "Get stored in a spatial storage cell"
	quest.33C05CA3A06893C4.title: "To boldly go"
	quest.34A29B45B62CCADE.quest_desc: ["Why bother with stairs when you can effortlessly teleport to a higher location or perform an impressive single-jump or crouch maneuver!"]
	quest.34A29B45B62CCADE.quest_subtitle: "Going Places"
	quest.387C93E247FB8132.quest_desc: [
		"Embark on an exciting journey in the Bounty Hunt questline! Your mission is to hunt down and eliminate specific Minecraft mobs scattered across the world."
		""
		"Each quest presents a unique challenge, where you'll face off against different mobs, including formidable bosses like the &1Warden&r, &1Ender Dragon&r, &1Elder Guardian&r, and &1Wither&r."
		""
		"Complete these quests successfully, and you'll be handsomely rewarded with valuable items, resources, and more!"
	]
	quest.387C93E247FB8132.quest_subtitle: "Introduction to Bounty Hunt"
	quest.3C5432CA82A8A454.quest_desc: ["This mod introduces a wide array of unrelated items, tools, machines, enchantments, and a few potions. To craft some of the more powerful items, you'll need to create these machines."]
	quest.3C5432CA82A8A454.quest_subtitle: "WTF even is this mod?"
	quest.3C5432CA82A8A454.title: "&2Cyclic"
	quest.3E60B509DE208B1A.quest_desc: [
		"To enhance your gameplay experience, we've integrated FTB Teams and FTB Chunks, two invaluable mods that will revolutionize your journey."
		""
		"FTB Teams allows you to forge alliances, collaborate, and embark on this adventure together. Team up with fellow players to conquer challenges, share resources, and build something truly magnificent. Whether you're a lone wolf or a cooperative spirit, FTB Teams offers endless possibilities."
		""
		"FTB Chunks introduces a new layer of security to your base. Safeguard your hard-earned resources, machines, and creations by claiming and protecting your territory. This mod empowers you to create impenetrable strongholds and defend them against any threat that may arise. You can find this by hitting M and then finding the buttons in the top left of the screen!"
	]
	quest.3E60B509DE208B1A.quest_subtitle: "How To Team and Protect"
	quest.3E60B509DE208B1A.title: "FTB Teams and Chunks"
	quest.3F65A43A7641875A.quest_desc: ["This mod simplifies interactions with villagers, offers various helpful blocks, and enhances gameplay related to trading and farming with villagers. Just Shift + Right Click to pick up a villager!"]
	quest.3F65A43A7641875A.quest_subtitle: "No more hassle, just easy trading!"
	quest.3F65A43A7641875A.title: "Easy Villagers"
	quest.40A262250EDD876A.quest_desc: [
		"With the Matter Receiver and Charged Porter from the RFTools mod, you gain a powerful teleportation system. "
		""
		"To set the destination for your Charged Porter, simply hold down the Shift key and right-click on a Matter Receiver."
	]
	quest.40A262250EDD876A.quest_subtitle: "Why walk when you can PORT!"
	quest.40A262250EDD876A.title: "Fast Travel"
	quest.4174E61EC4ED9130.quest_desc: ["Learn to set up farms, machines, and systems for continuous resource production, and become a master of automation to ensure your world thrives. The real challenge lies in organizing it all!"]
	quest.4174E61EC4ED9130.quest_subtitle: "Resource automation: Let's 'dig' into it!"
	quest.4174E61EC4ED9130.title: "&eAutomate Resources"
	quest.43A88E9371891A4F.quest_subtitle: "Slay the Rat King"
	quest.43A88E9371891A4F.title: "King of the World!"
	quest.4484F353031EEAE3.quest_desc: ["This highly versatile mod offers extensive item transportation options within the Minecraft world. It revolves around a central block known as the Item Router, complemented by an array of plug-in module items. Notably, it can emulate the use of tools, weapons, and items, effectively mimicking your in-game actions when utilizing the Activator module."]
	quest.4484F353031EEAE3.quest_subtitle: "Click Click Click"
	quest.4484F353031EEAE3.title: "Modular Routers"
	quest.452F2A05F48345E2.quest_desc: ["The best way to get started is to head out and explore initially, rather than immediately digging straight down to mine for diamonds. Exploring will help you discover an ideal location to establish your base and can lead you to discover some incredible loot, providing you with a significant advantage against the mobs you're sure to encounter on your first night."]
	quest.452F2A05F48345E2.quest_subtitle: "Just a bit of HELP"
	quest.46ADA718BA2413AA.quest_desc: ["Do you want to build cool things in Minecraft, like a big sandstone castle, a fiery Nether fortress, a simple dirt house, or even a totem pole with funny diorite faces? Well, you're in the right place! We've got you covered for all your building ideas!"]
	quest.46ADA718BA2413AA.quest_subtitle: "Don't 'block' creativity"
	quest.46ADA718BA2413AA.title: "Better Blocks"
	quest.46EAD1F1816B02BC.quest_subtitle: "Get your familiar from Occultism to dance"
	quest.46EAD1F1816B02BC.title: "Dance!"
	quest.48512AEEDD688F1E.quest_subtitle: "Eat a course of every meal available from Farmer's Delight"
	quest.48512AEEDD688F1E.title: "Master Chef"
	quest.49A97AE44D770A6A.quest_subtitle: "Reach 2048 channels using devices on a network from AE2"
	quest.49A97AE44D770A6A.title: "Network Administrator"
	quest.4BD2613F66A49FEB.quest_desc: ["Reliquary offers a range of magical items and blocks that might pose a challenge to obtain but significantly improve various aspects of a player's life in Minecraft."]
	quest.4BD2613F66A49FEB.quest_subtitle: "You wanted MORE mob loot?"
	quest.4BD2613F66A49FEB.title: "&dReliquary Reincarnations"
	quest.4BE7CD9C93FDB95A.quest_desc: [
		"Industrial Foregoing is a mod that allows you to automate most of minecraft's functions. It has machines for everything!"
		""
		"- Mob and animal farming"
		"- Plant farming"
		"- A suite of Infinity tools"
		"- Big item/fluid storage and item/fluid transporters"
		"- Power generation"
		"- Enchantments sorting and creation"
		"- Much more..."
	]
	quest.4BE7CD9C93FDB95A.quest_subtitle: "Meaty infusion!"
	quest.4BE7CD9C93FDB95A.title: "&2Industrial Forgoing"
	quest.4D69B8FEEB4622D0.quest_desc: ["When exploring underground, you might stumble upon new Geods. These geodes can be harvested using conventional methods, and you can even automate the resource production process. Fortunately, you can achieve automatic harvesting and crystal propagation using the Ars Nouveau mod with golems."]
	quest.4D69B8FEEB4622D0.quest_subtitle: "Crystal-clear automation"
	quest.4D69B8FEEB4622D0.title: "&eGeOres"
	quest.4ED8E81C7A1C5169.quest_subtitle: "Collect all Fossil Parts"
	quest.4ED8E81C7A1C5169.title: "Paleontologist's Pride"
	quest.4EE8DFAD5E857CDF.quest_desc: [
		"Rats is a mod all about rats. Obviously."
		"Rats are creatures that spawn at night in the Overworld much like monsters. Usually they are afraid of players and will run from them on sight, but they can become quite a nuisance as rats are able to dig through wooden walls, steal food \\& seeds from chests, and destroy crops! And on top of all that, rats can sneak through fences and navigate through doors!"
	]
	quest.4EE8DFAD5E857CDF.quest_subtitle: "Don't look up Rat King!"
	quest.4EE8DFAD5E857CDF.title: "&2Rats"
	quest.53B1F54939F17BDE.quest_desc: ["You might have noticed the absence of tool mods like Silent Gears and Tinkers' Construct. The reason behind this choice is to encourage you to explore and utilize alternative tools from other mods included in the pack, such as Cyclic and many more. Best of luck in your quest to discover the most suitable tools for your adventure!"]
	quest.53B1F54939F17BDE.quest_subtitle: "'Pick' your tools"
	quest.547498B4AE9DF642.quest_subtitle: "A lot of a Little Bit"
	quest.547498B4AE9DF642.title: "&aCrafting Essentials"
	quest.5513B8281E672711.quest_desc: ["Ars Nouveau is a magic mod inspired by Ars Magicka that allows players to craft their own spells, create magical artifacts, perform rituals, and much more."]
	quest.5513B8281E672711.quest_subtitle: "'Tech'nically MAGIC"
	quest.5513B8281E672711.title: "&dArs Nouveau"
	quest.55825DA963839368.quest_subtitle: "Craft an infinite storage disk!"
	quest.55825DA963839368.title: "Infinite Storage"
	quest.55F0473C3A77A993.quest_desc: ["Tech! In this quest, you'll dive into the exciting realm of technology-focused mods. These mods introduce a wide array of machines, devices, and automation tools that can transform your Minecraft experience. From crafting powerful equipment to automating resource production, you'll have the opportunity to harness the full potential of technology in your Minecraft adventures. Get ready to discover the innovative and game-changing possibilities that tech mods have to offer!"]
	quest.55F0473C3A77A993.quest_subtitle: "Automation be free!"
	quest.55F0473C3A77A993.title: "&2Tech Starts Here"
	quest.56F36FE0DF4BB039.quest_subtitle: "Why haven't you built a castle yet?"
	quest.56F36FE0DF4BB039.title: "&aCall A Place Home"
	quest.57BE7DB5368AE564.quest_desc: ["Embark on your journey and conquer optional challenges using the Minecraft Advancement system, where mods have crafted unique goals for you to achieve. Discover new dimensions, master magical arts, explore advanced technology, and become the ultimate adventurer. The choice is yours, and the rewards are waiting!"]
	quest.57BE7DB5368AE564.quest_subtitle: "Choose your own advanture"
	quest.59C61B51DD8FDFC7.quest_desc: ["If you have all Mycelial Generators from Industrial Foregoing running simultaneously without stopping, the Mycelial Reactor will produce 25 MRF/T, generating more power than just using the base generators by themselves."]
	quest.59C61B51DD8FDFC7.quest_subtitle: "25 Milion RF Per Tick Generation"
	quest.59C61B51DD8FDFC7.title: "&cMycelial Reactor"
	quest.5D395272E9F0483A.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade an Endshelf into a Draconic Endshelf"
	quest.5D395272E9F0483A.title: "The Final Bookshelf"
	quest.5DA025C82314EEFA.quest_desc: ["If you can't use or don't prefer the shaders, or if you'd like to select your own, simply press the 'O' key. This will open the shader settings menu."]
	quest.5DA025C82314EEFA.quest_subtitle: "How to Enable or Disable Shaders"
	quest.5DA025C82314EEFA.title: "Shaders?"
	quest.5DF052F2F7DB1370.quest_desc: ["This mod draws inspiration from Roleplaying Games, Fantasy, the Supernatural, Magic, the Occult, Mythologies, and Legends. It seamlessly integrates elements from Thaumcraft into your gameplay, creating an immersive and harmonious experience. Our aim is to enhance your gaming enjoyment, ensuring that your character's progression aligns with your equipment's advancements in a balanced manner."]
	quest.5DF052F2F7DB1370.quest_subtitle: "Truly unbreakable"
	quest.5DF052F2F7DB1370.title: "&dForbidden and Arcanus"
	quest.61107DAFE85BFAEA.quest_desc: ["LaserIO seeks to replicate the mechanics of EnderIO - allowing you to interact with items, fluids, energy, and redstone all from the same block face! Furthermore, 9 separate configurations can be placed per block face, leading to nearly limitless potential for logistics around transportation of resources. "]
	quest.61107DAFE85BFAEA.quest_subtitle: "Is this the BEST pipe mob?"
	quest.61107DAFE85BFAEA.title: "LaserIO"
	quest.628A7C52E98EB761.quest_subtitle: "Use a AXE!"
	quest.628A7C52E98EB761.title: "&aPunch Logs"
	quest.63A03D02BA67D127.quest_subtitle: "Find A Way"
	quest.663B5408E4F4F141.quest_desc: [
		"Apotheosis is a content mod that allows you to become stronger than ever before, while trying to stay true to vanilla mechanics at heart. Every feature is carefully put together to feel cohesive and complete."
		""
		"Features range from simple changes, like taller sugarcane, to massive overhauls of core systems such as Enchanting."
	]
	quest.663B5408E4F4F141.quest_subtitle: "I'm not OP, you are!"
	quest.663B5408E4F4F141.title: "&dApotheosis"
	quest.699D136AC468B98A.title: "Kill Wither"
	quest.69C2D2CE0D927CC2.quest_desc: [
		"Shrink is a small mod for Minecraft that allows players to change their player's size."
		""
		"Shrinking to a smaller size allows the player to access places that they could normally not access without breaking blocks."
		""
		"You can also change the size of other mobs by punching them with this."
	]
	quest.69C2D2CE0D927CC2.quest_subtitle: "Honey, I Shrunk the Chicken!"
	quest.69C2D2CE0D927CC2.title: "Fit In Small Spaces"
	quest.6D5F300C06C30A5F.quest_desc: [
		"&lSocialised Loot"
		"Open one of every type of instanced, per-player Loot container in the world!"
		""
		"&lCentennial"
		"Open 100 instanced, per-player Loot containers and collect your rewards!"
	]
	quest.6D5F300C06C30A5F.quest_subtitle: "Loot MASTER"
	quest.70C3D9D8D1610CC6.quest_desc: [
		"This mod is inspired by the world of Jonathan Stroud's Bartimaeus. If you haven't read the books, do that now!"
		"With the help of occult rituals you will summon spirits, also known as demons, from \"The Other Place\" to aid you in your adventures. "
		""
		"A ritual magic system centered around summonable spirits allows you to automate various tasks, store vast amounts of items, let demons mine in void dimensions, create powerful enchanted tools and jewelry, get support from familiars, and much much more."
		""
		"Begin your journey by crafting the Dictionary of Spirits, and following that in-game guide, discover the secrets of the spirit world,"
		"find otherworld groves hidden in plain sight by gaining the \"Third Eye\", and finally summon your first spirit.  "
	]
	quest.70C3D9D8D1610CC6.quest_subtitle: "Where magic meets sarcasm"
	quest.70C3D9D8D1610CC6.title: "&dOccultism"
	quest.73195C3BC3DEB979.quest_subtitle: "Get a 100% readout from a Stressometer"
	quest.73195C3BC3DEB979.title: "Perfectly Stressed"
	quest.738DE7BD511C3BF5.quest_desc: [
		"What's Coming Next:"
		""
		"- More quests"
		""
		"- Additional mods"
		""
		"- And much more!"
	]
	quest.738DE7BD511C3BF5.title: "What's Coming Next"
	quest.7488A5CD719646D9.quest_subtitle: "Pave your way"
	quest.7488A5CD719646D9.title: "&aBest Block In Minecraft"
	quest.75E08E40560B1952.quest_desc: ["The best way to get started is to head out and explore initially, rather than immediately digging straight down to mine for diamonds. Exploring will help you discover an ideal location to establish your base and can lead you to discover some incredible loot, providing you with a significant advantage against the mobs you're sure to encounter on your first night."]
	quest.75E08E40560B1952.quest_subtitle: "Just a bit of HELP"
	quest.764C4D6535BDEFCE.quest_desc: ["Enhance your Minecraft experience with these convenient quality of life mods. Streamline gameplay, improve inventory management, and simplify crafting with these handy additions. Explore the world more efficiently and enjoy a smoother adventure in Minecraft."]
	quest.764C4D6535BDEFCE.quest_subtitle: "Optimizing At Its Finest"
	quest.771DD93057DD5E21.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome, adventurer, to the vast and wondrous world of &l&6Urmoit's Adventure 2&r! In this epic journey, you'll embark on a thrilling exploration of the amazing mods available in the 1.20s version of Minecraft."
		""
		"Your adventure begins here, and the possibilities are endless. Whether you're an experienced modded Minecraft player or new to the world of modifications, this quest book will be your guide to unlocking the mysteries and marvels that await."
	]
	quest.771DD93057DD5E21.quest_subtitle: "ADVENTURE TIME"
	quest.771DD93057DD5E21.title: "&bWelcome Adventurer!"
	quest.77A815B084782AD1.quest_desc: ["Sometimes, building large structures can be a little tedious, and take a lot of effort. Not all of us a great builders you know! Dire's Building Gadgets aims to make building a little bit easier."]
	quest.77A815B084782AD1.quest_subtitle: "Direwolf20 Approved"
	quest.77A815B084782AD1.title: "Building Gadgets"
	quest.77EDBB84989D1B26.quest_desc: ["Item Collectors adds Collectors which collect items in a specified range! Item Collectors range can be changed and items can be whitelisted or blacklisted!"]
	quest.77EDBB84989D1B26.quest_subtitle: "Will Destroy you in Pick Up Sticks"
	quest.78C33291D2221AA7.quest_subtitle: "POWER for POWER"
	quest.78C33291D2221AA7.title: "&cGetting Started With Power"
	quest.7A627A935A840AC4.quest_desc: [
		"&lPlacement of Mega Torches:&r One of the primary features of the mod is the ability to craft and place \"Mega Torches.\" These torches emit an exceptionally high level of light, preventing hostile mobs from spawning within a certain radius. They are useful for creating safe zones around your base or in specific areas."
		""
		"&lFeral Flare Lanterns:&r This mod also introduces Feral Flare Lanterns, which can be used to repel hostile mobs within a designated range. They provide an alternative way to keep your surroundings safe from threats."
		""
		"&lLantern Control:&r TorchMaster offers control over lanterns' behavior, allowing players to customize their settings. You can adjust lanterns to function as Mega Torches, Feral Flare "
	]
	quest.7A627A935A840AC4.quest_subtitle: "Light Up The Night"
	quest.7A627A935A840AC4.title: "Torchmaster"
	quest.7B02E5FA9EDF70B0.quest_subtitle: "Get every food from Corn Delight!"
	quest.7B02E5FA9EDF70B0.title: "Master Corn knowledge"
	quest.7C7C5A2F8549BB75.quest_subtitle: "Catch a lightning bolt in a containment jar from Ars"
	quest.7C7C5A2F8549BB75.title: "Lightning in a Bottle"
	quest.7F15EE148401703F.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Create, a mod that provides a wide array of tools and blocks for building, decoration, and aesthetic automation in Minecraft. Our tech elements are designed to empower players with creative choices, allowing you to craft contraptions of animated components that work together in countless configurations. "
		""
		"With Create, the game doesn't confine you to user interfaces; instead, it encourages you to construct intricate systems with moving parts. Explore Create's in-game documentation, 'Ponder,' which will walk you through all the added mechanics and gadgets."
	]
	quest.7F15EE148401703F.quest_subtitle: "Relax and don't 'overstress'"
	quest.7F15EE148401703F.title: "&2Create"
	quest.7FCB4EA81AE9DA65.quest_desc: [
		"To enhance your gameplay experience, we've integrated FTB Teams and FTB Chunks, two invaluable mods that will revolutionize your journey."
		""
		"FTB Teams allows you to forge alliances, collaborate, and embark on this adventure together. Team up with fellow players to conquer challenges, share resources, and build something truly magnificent. Whether you're a lone wolf or a cooperative spirit, FTB Teams offers endless possibilities."
		""
		"FTB Chunks introduces a new layer of security to your base. Safeguard your hard-earned resources, machines, and creations by claiming and protecting your territory. This mod empowers you to create impenetrable strongholds and defend them against any threat that may arise. You can find this by hitting M and then finding the buttons in the top left of the screen!"
	]
	quest.7FCB4EA81AE9DA65.quest_subtitle: "How To Team and Protect"
